#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter-gst.xml:28
msgid "Introduction to Clutter Gst"
msgstr "Introdução ao <quote>Clutter Gst</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/clutter-gst.xml:31
msgid ""
"The <application>Clutter Gst</application> package contains an integration "
"library for using <application>GStreamer</application> with "
"<application>Clutter</application>. Its purpose is to implement the "
"ClutterMedia interface using <application>GStreamer</application>."
msgstr ""
"O pacote &quot;<application>Clutter Gst</application>&quot; contém uma "
"biblioteca de integração para usar o "
"&quot;<application>GStreamer</application>&quot; com o "
"&quot;<application>Clutter</application>&quot;. O objetivo dela é o de "
"implementar a interface &quot;ClutterMedia&quot; usando o "
"&quot;<application>GStreamer</application>&quot;."

